# TEXT, checkable by re-reading it. Nothing here ever says what the
# server should DO — that is the decision under test. A case with no
# `route` is live-only and must say why in `liveOnlyReason`.
#
# `adjudication` is required whenever an expectation was CHANGED rather
# than ported: the verdict (old_right | new_right | harness), the date,
# and a sentence a human can check. "It went green" is not a reason.
#
