llo\n7. Faris Nasser\n\nWe need *7 more*. Reply *IN* to grab a spot."},{"author":"Idris Bello","body":"need a few more lads"}],"messages":[{"from":"aydin","body":"In. For bench👍","route":"self_att","facts":{"claims":[{"subject":"sender","polarity":"bench"}]}}],"expect":{"attendance":[{"player":"aydin","status":"BENCH"}],"counts":{"confirmed":7,"bench":1}},"tags":["bench","explicit-intent"],"adjudication":{"verdict":"harness","date":"2026-09-08","reason":"Expectation untouched. 'In. For bench' states a BENCH preference in so many words; `polarity: bench` is the transcription and PR #27's rule (an EXPLICIT bench is honoured at any capacity) is the engine's."}}
{"id":"S6-najib-in-at-full-squad","title":"an IN at a 14/14 squad with an empty bench must still write something","sections":["S6","S10"],"category":"D","provenance":{"kind":"commit","ref":"f61a897","date":"2026-05-08","player":"Najib Ahmadi","note":"Najib posted 'In' at 22:33 BST with the squad 14/14 and the bench empty. The model emitted intent='in' with registerAttendance:null, reasoning 'This is odd'. No row was written; three days later when two players dropped he was nowhere in the squad and lost his slot for a week."},"stubKind":"transcribed","world":{"maxPlayers":14,"players":[{"key":"kemal","name":"Kemal Ediz","role":"OWNER"},{"key":"elvin","name":"Elvin Aliyev","role":"ADMIN"},{"key":"sait","name":"Sait Demir"},{"key":"mustafa","name":"Mustafa Kaya"},{"key":"abid","name":"Abid Hussain"},{"key":"idris","name":"Idris Bello"},{"key":"faris","name":"Faris Nasser"},{"key":"shaz","name":"Shaz Iqbal"},{"key":"adam","name":"Adam Osman"},{"key":"efat","name":"Efat Rahman"},{"key":"usama","name":"Usama Tariq"},{"key":"karahan","name":"Karahan Yildiz"},{"key":"zair","name":"Zair Malik"},{"key":"wasim","name":"Wasim Akhtar"},{"key":"habib","name":"Habib Rahimi"},{"key":"najib","name":"Najib Ahmadi"},{"key":"ehtisham","name":"Ehtisham Ul Haq"},{"key":"mojib","name":"Mojib Sadat"},{"key":"erdal","name":"Erdal Ozkan"},{"key":"enayem","name":"Enayem Rashid"},{"key":"amir","name":"Amir Ahmadi"},{"key":"zeeshan","name":"Zeeshan Khan"},{"key":"ayoub","name":"Ayoub Benali"}],"attendance":[{"key":"kemal","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"elvin","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"sait","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"mustafa","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"abid","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"idris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"faris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"shaz","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"adam","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"efat","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"usama","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"karahan","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"zair","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"wasim","status":"CONFIRMED"}]},"history":[{"author":"MatchTime","body":"🗓 *Tuesday 7-a-side* — Tue 21:30 at Goals North Cheam.\n\n*Confirmed (14/14):*\n1. Kemal Ediz\n2. Elvin Aliyev\n3. Sait Demir\n4. Mustafa Kaya\n5. Abid Hussain\n6. Idris Bello\n7. Faris Nasser\n8. Shaz Iqbal\n9. Adam Osman\n10. Efat Rahman\n11. Usama Tariq\n12. Karahan Yildiz\n13. Zair Malik\n14. Wasim Akhtar\n\nSquad is *full* 🙌"},{"author":"Wasim Akhtar","body":"squad's full lads"}],"messages":[{"from":"najib","body":"In","route":"self_att","facts":{"claims":[{"subject":"sender","polarity":"in"}]}}],"expect":{"attendance":[{"player":"najib","status":"BENCH"}],"counts":{"confirmed":14,"bench":1}},"tags":["capacity","seatbelt","lost-slot"],"adjudication":{"verdict":"harness","date":"2026-09-08","reason":"Expectation untouched, and the case changes character for the better: the incident was the MODEL refusing to write ('this is odd'), and a model can no longer refuse — 'In' is one claim and capacity is the engine's arithmetic."}}
{"id":"S7-erdal-words-must-match-action","title":"a reply that announces a bench move must be backed by the write","sections":["S7","S10"],"category":"D","provenance":{"kind":"commit","ref":"bef5252","date":"2026-05-15","player":"Erdal Ozkan","note":"Hasan asked whether MatchTime should put Erdal on the bench. The model reasoned it through and replied 'Erdal goes on the bench. 👍' with intent question and NO registerFor — the group saw the announcement, the DB had no row, and he would have shown up on Tuesday with no slot."},"stubKind":"transcribed","world":{"maxPlayers":14,"players":[{"key":"kemal","name":"Kemal Ediz","role":"OWNER"},{"key":"elvin","name":"Elvin Aliyev","role":"ADMIN"},{"key":"sait","name":"Sait Demir"},{"key":"mustafa","name":"Mustafa Kaya"},{"key":"abid","name":"Abid Hussain"},{"key":"idris","name":"Idris Bello"},{"key":"faris","name":"Faris Nasser"},{"key":"shaz","name":"Shaz Iqbal"},{"key":"adam","name":"Adam Osman"},{"key":"efat","name":"Efat Rahman"},{"key":"usama","name":"Usama Tariq"},{"key":"karahan","name":"Karahan Yildiz"},{"key":"zair","name":"Zair Malik"},{"key":"wasim","name":"Wasim Akhtar"},{"key":"habib","name":"Habib Rahimi"},{"key":"najib","name":"Najib Ahmadi"},{"key":"ehtisham","name":"Ehtisham Ul Haq"},{"key":"mojib","name":"Mojib Sadat"},{"key":"erdal","name":"Erdal Ozkan"},{"key":"enayem","name":"Enayem Rashid"},{"key":"amir","name":"Amir Ahmadi"},{"key":"zeeshan","name":"Zeeshan Khan"},{"key":"ayoub","name":"Ayoub Benali"},{"key":"hasan","name":"Hasan Yildirim"}],"attendance":[{"key":"kemal","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"elvin","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"sait","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"mustafa","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"abid","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"idris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"faris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"shaz","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"adam","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"efat","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"usama","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"karahan","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"zair","status":"CONFIRMED"}]},"history":[{"author":"Erdal Ozkan","body":"consider me as the 14th whenever you have 13 players"},{"author":"MatchTime","body":"Got it Erdal 👍"}],"messages":[{"from":"hasan","tag":true,"body":"@Match Time Should MatchTime put Erdal to the bench or not?","route":"question","facts":{"topic":"person_status","personRef":"Erdal","statedCount":-1}}],"expect":{"claimsMatchWrites":true,"speaks":"required","mustMention":["Erdal"]},"notes":"The known-correct outcome is a CONSISTENCY property, not a particular write: MatchTime may answer the question or make the move, but it may never announce a move the database did not make. Asserting a specific write here would encode one of the two acceptable answers. FIDELITY CAVEAT: the production message was UNTAGGED. It carries an @Match Time tag here because the interaction contract (19f43e3, 2026-06-18, narrowed by bd3305d) landed AFTER this incident and now requires a tag for every directed op, so the untagged original can no longer reach the behaviour this case exists to pin. See the 2026-09-01 note in MDs/analyzer-redesign-2026-08-31.md section 3.2. ROUTE CHOICE, stated because it is a judgement and not a transcription: the message is routed `question`, not `other_att`. It is phrased as one ('…or not?'), it asks MatchTime what MatchTime should do rather than instructing it, and `question` is the reading the incident itself had (the model emitted intent=question and then announced a move anyway, which is the whole case). Routed `other_att` the engine would refuse it on the admin-only bench rule and the case would pass for a reason that has nothing to do with S7.","tags":["consistency","announcement"],"contractTagAdded":true,"adjudication":{"verdict":"new_right","date":"2026-09-08","reason":"`speaks` moves from 'any' to 'required' and gains `mustMention: Erdal`. The consistency property is unchanged and is still the point — MatchTime may answer or may move him, but may never announce a move the database did not make. 'any' meant a bot that said nothing at all passed, which is how this case sat green through a sweep that routed nothing; a question about a named player must be ANSWERED."}}
{"id":"S8-salman-admin-demote-to-bench","title":"'move Salman to bench, keep Talha' demotes Salman and frees his slot","sections":["S8"],"category":"B","provenance":{"kind":"commit","ref":"9afa357","date":"2026-06-11","player":"Salman Shelly","note":"There was no third-party BENCH action, so the instruction had nowhere to land: the model wrote bench-sounding text while the DB kept Salman CONFIRMED, he appeared in BOTH the Playing list and the Bench line, and the misread triggered duplicate 'Squad complete' posts. The prompt calls this 'the SINGLE MOST IMPORTANT case to get right'."},"stubKind":"transcribed","world":{"maxPlayers":14,"players":[{"key":"kemal","name":"Kemal Ediz","role":"OWNER"},{"key":"elvin","name":"Elvin Aliyev","role":"ADMIN"},{"key":"sait","name":"Sait Demir"},{"key":"mustafa","name":"Mustafa Kaya"},{"key":"abid","name":"Abid Hussain"},{"key":"idris","name":"Idris Bello"},{"key":"faris","name":"Faris Nasser"},{"key":"shaz","name":"Shaz Iqbal"},{"key":"adam","name":"Adam Osman"},{"key":"efat","name":"Efat Rahman"},{"key":"usama","name":"Usama Tariq"},{"key":"karahan","name":"Karahan Yildiz"},{"key":"zair","name":"Zair Malik"},{"key":"wasim","name":"Wasim Akhtar"},{"key":"habib","name":"Habib Rahimi"},{"key":"najib","name":"Najib Ahmadi"},{"key":"ehtisham","name":"Ehtisham Ul Haq"},{"key":"mojib","name":"Mojib Sadat"},{"key":"erdal","name":"Erdal Ozkan"},{"key":"enayem","name":"Enayem Rashid"},{"key":"amir","name":"Amir Ahmadi"},{"key":"zeeshan","name":"Zeeshan Khan"},{"key":"ayoub","name":"Ayoub Benali"},{"key":"salman","name":"Salman Shelly"},{"key":"talha","name":"Talha Younis"}],"attendance":[{"key":"kemal","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"sait","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"mustafa","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"abid","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"idris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"faris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"shaz","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"adam","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"efat","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"usama","status":"CONF