me","body":"🗓 *Tuesday 7-a-side* — Tue 21:30 at Goals North Cheam.\n\n*Confirmed (14/14):*\n1. Kemal Ediz\n2. Elvin Aliyev\n3. Sait Demir\n4. Mustafa Kaya\n5. Abid Hussain\n6. Idris Bello\n7. Faris Nasser\n8. Shaz Iqbal\n9. Adam Osman\n10. Efat Rahman\n11. Usama Tariq\n12. Mojib Sadat\n13. Habib Rahimi\n14. Zair Malik\n\nSquad is *full* 🙌"},{"author":"Adam Osman","body":"21:30 tonight yeah?"}],"messages":[{"from":"mojib","tag":true,"body":"@Match Time is anyone able to replace me and habibi tonight?"}],"expect":{"attendance":[{"player":"mojib","status":"DROPPED"},{"player":"habib","status":"DROPPED"}],"counts":{"confirmed":12}},"notes":"The production message was UNTAGGED. It is tagged here because the interaction contract (19f43e3, 2026-06-18, narrowed by bd3305d) landed three weeks AFTER f35dfe6 and gates any registerFor carrying a non-IN entry behind an @Match Time tag — so the untagged original can no longer reach the OUT safety net this case exists to test. The untagged behaviour is its own case, S2b, rather than being silently folded into this one.","tags":["drop","seatbelt"],"contractTagAdded":true,"liveOnlyReason":"The READING of this message was the incident, so any stub would contain the answer. 'is anyone able to replace me and habibi tonight?' is exactly the sentence the archive cannot agree about: §3.2's 2026-09-01 note measured the shipped extractor calling it flavour (b) 'tentative' in a minority of 100 runs, and calling 'habibi' an endearment rather than a name 3 times out of 3 — and the incident (f35dfe6) was the model dropping Habib and not Mojib. Hand-writing `polarity: out` for both is writing the answer key. Live, it asserts the OUTCOME: both DROPPED, squad 12.","adjudication":{"verdict":"new_right","date":"2026-09-08","reason":"The expectation is unchanged; only where it runs moved. It was `stubKind: historical`, which meant 'the verdict the model emitted on the day' — and there is no historical router or extractor output, because neither existed on 2026-05-26."}}
{"id":"S2b-untagged-third-party-drop-is-gated","title":"an untagged message that would drop SOMEONE ELSE does nothing at all","sections":["S2","S12"],"category":"B","provenance":{"kind":"commit","ref":"19f43e3, bd3305d","date":"2026-06-18","note":"The interaction contract. Adds of a NAMED player are tag-free; 'removing or moving someone who never consented stays an explicit, tagged op'. Untagged means no action, no reply, no reaction, DB unchanged. Verified in interaction-contract.ts:114-143, which §9 lists as one of the 22 seatbelts that SURVIVES the redesign unchanged."},"stubKind":"transcribed","world":{"maxPlayers":14,"players":[{"key":"kemal","name":"Kemal Ediz","role":"OWNER"},{"key":"elvin","name":"Elvin Aliyev","role":"ADMIN"},{"key":"sait","name":"Sait Demir"},{"key":"mustafa","name":"Mustafa Kaya"},{"key":"abid","name":"Abid Hussain"},{"key":"idris","name":"Idris Bello"},{"key":"faris","name":"Faris Nasser"},{"key":"shaz","name":"Shaz Iqbal"},{"key":"adam","name":"Adam Osman"},{"key":"efat","name":"Efat Rahman"},{"key":"usama","name":"Usama Tariq"},{"key":"karahan","name":"Karahan Yildiz"},{"key":"zair","name":"Zair Malik"},{"key":"wasim","name":"Wasim Akhtar"},{"key":"habib","name":"Habib Rahimi"},{"key":"najib","name":"Najib Ahmadi"},{"key":"ehtisham","name":"Ehtisham Ul Haq"},{"key":"mojib","name":"Mojib Sadat"},{"key":"erdal","name":"Erdal Ozkan"},{"key":"enayem","name":"Enayem Rashid"},{"key":"amir","name":"Amir Ahmadi"},{"key":"zeeshan","name":"Zeeshan Khan"},{"key":"ayoub","name":"Ayoub Benali"}],"attendance":[{"key":"kemal","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"elvin","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"sait","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"mustafa","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"abid","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"idris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"faris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"shaz","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"adam","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"efat","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"usama","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"mojib","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key"