{"id":"S12b-kemal-chase-nudge-is-not-a-drop","title":"'@all we need more players pls' must never drop the person asking","sections":["S12","S30"],"category":"B","provenance":{"kind":"commit","ref":"1daf7db","date":"2026-05-28","player":"Kemal Ediz","note":"The OUT safety net added two days earlier fired on a group-level chase nudge and dropped Kemal from his own squad. The second half of that seatbelt exists ONLY because the first half caused an incident two days after shipping."},"stubKind":"transcribed","world":{"maxPlayers":14,"players":[{"key":"kemal","name":"Kemal Ediz","role":"OWNER"},{"key":"elvin","name":"Elvin Aliyev","role":"ADMIN"},{"key":"sait","name":"Sait Demir"},{"key":"mustafa","name":"Mustafa Kaya"},{"key":"abid","name":"Abid Hussain"},{"key":"idris","name":"Idris Bello"},{"key":"faris","name":"Faris Nasser"},{"key":"shaz","name":"Shaz Iqbal"},{"key":"adam","name":"Adam Osman"},{"key":"efat","name":"Efat Rahman"},{"key":"usama","name":"Usama Tariq"},{"key":"karahan","name":"Karahan Yildiz"},{"key":"zair","name":"Zair Malik"},{"key":"wasim","name":"Wasim Akhtar"},{"key":"habib","name":"Habib Rahimi"},{"key":"najib","name":"Najib Ahmadi"},{"key":"ehtisham","name":"Ehtisham Ul Haq"},{"key":"mojib","name":"Mojib Sadat"},{"key":"erdal","name":"Erdal Ozkan"},{"key":"enayem","name":"Enayem Rashid"},{"key":"amir","name":"Amir Ahmadi"},{"key":"zeeshan","name":"Zeeshan Khan"},{"key":"ayoub","name":"Ayoub Benali"}],"attendance":[{"key":"kemal","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"elvin","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"sait","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"mustafa","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"abid","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"idris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"faris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"shaz","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"adam","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"efat","status":"CONFIRMED"}]},"history":[{"author":"MatchTime","body":"🗓 *Tuesday 7-a-side* — Tue 21:30 at Goals North Cheam.\n\n*Confirmed (10/14):*\n1. Kemal Ediz\n2. Elvin Aliyev\n3. Sait Demir\n4. Mustafa Kaya\n5. Abid Hussain\n6. Idris Bello\n7. Faris Nasser\n8. Shaz Iqbal\n9. Adam Osman\n10. Efat Rahman\n\nWe need *4 more*. Reply *IN* to grab a spot."},{"author":"Shaz Iqbal","body":"still 4 short"}],"messages":[{"from":"kemal","body":"@all we need more players pls","route":"unsure","facts":{"claims":[],"sideRequests":["chase"]}},{"from":"karahan","body":"in","route":"self_att","facts":{"claims":[{"subject":"sender","polarity":"in"}]}}],"expect":{"attendance":[{"player":"kemal","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"player":"karahan","status":"CONFIRMED"}],"counts":{"confirmed":11}},"tags":["chase","seatbelt","false-positive"],"notes":"STRENGTHENED 2026-09-08: Karahan's 'in' is a CANARY. '@all we need more players pls' carries `sideRequests: [chase]` and NO claims, so the engine's chase branch is what must leave Kemal alone — but silence satisfies that too, and the canary is what a silent pipeline cannot satisfy.","adjudication":{"verdict":"new_right","date":"2026-09-08","reason":"Kemal's expectation is unchanged (the nudge never drops the asker); Karahan is a canary and the count moves 10 → 11 with him. Route `unsure` is the honest answer for a nudge with no attendance claim in it, and §11.1's asymmetry sends every doubt to the attendance extractor rather than to silence."}}
{"id":"S13-third-party-nomination-cannot-claim-slot","title":"a non-bencher nominating someone does not register them; the offer stays open","sections":["S13"],"category":"B","provenance":{"kind":"commit","ref":"9a12ace","date":"2026-05-19","player":"Karahan Yildiz","note":"The offer-to-all redesign that replaced the elimination chain: one offer to the WHOLE bench, first to claim plays, nobody is ever dropped for being slow or silent. A non-bencher cannot pick who fills a slot."},"world":{"maxPlayers":14,"players":[{"key":"kemal","name":"Kemal Ediz","role":"OWNER"},{"key":"elvin","name":"Elvin Aliyev","role":"ADMIN"},{"key":"sait","name":"Sait Demir"},{"key":"mustafa","name":"Mustafa Kaya"},{"key":"abid","name":"Abid Hussain"},{"key":"idris","name":"Idris Bello"},{"key":"faris","name":"Faris Nasser"},{"key":"shaz","name":"Shaz Iqbal"},{"key":"adam","name":"Adam Osman"},{"key":"efat","name":"Efat Rahman"},{"key":"usama","name":"Usama Tariq"},{"key":"karahan","name":"Karahan Yildiz"},{"key":"zair","name":"Zair Malik"},{"key":"wasim","name":"Wasim Akhtar"},{"key":"habib","name":"Habib Rahimi"},{"key":"najib","name":"Najib Ahmadi"},{"key":"ehtisham","name":"Ehtisham Ul Haq"},{"key":"mojib","name":"Mojib Sadat"},{"key":"erdal","name":"Erdal Ozkan"},{"key":"enayem","name":"Enayem Rashid"},{"key":"amir","name":"Amir Ahmadi"},{"key":"zeeshan","name":"Zeeshan Khan"},{"key":"ayoub","name":"Ayoub Benali"}],"attendance":[{"key":"kemal","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"elvin","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"sait","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"mustafa","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"abid","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"idris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"faris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"shaz","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"adam","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"efat","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"usama","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"najib","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"zair","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"wasim","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"karahan","status":"BENCH"},{"key":"enayem","status":"BENCH"}],"openBenchSlotByDropping":"wasim"},"history":[{"author":"MatchTime","body":"A slot just opened 🎟 First of Karahan Yildiz, Enayem Rashid to say IN takes it — nobody gets dropped."},{"author":"Adam Osman","body":"someone grab it"}],"messages":[{"from":"adam","tag":true,"body":"@Match Time give the spot to Karahan","route":"other_att","facts":{"claims":[{"subject":"other","personRef":"Karahan","personNamed":true,"polarity":"in"}]}},{"from":"enayem","body":"I'll take it","turn":1,"route":"self_att","facts":{"claims":[{"subject":"sender","polarity":"in"}]}}],"expect":{"attendance":[{"player":"karahan","status":"BENCH"},{"player":"enayem","status":"CONFIRMED"}],"counts":{"confirmed":14},"benchOffersOpen":0},"tags":["bench-offer","nomination"],"stubKind":"transcribed","contractTagAdded":true,"notes":"FIDELITY CAVEAT: the production message was UNTAGGED. It carries an @Match Time tag here because the interaction contract (19f43e3, 2026-06-18, narrowed by bd3305d) landed AFTER this incident and now requires a tag for every directed op, so the untagged original can no longer reach the behaviour this case exists to pin. See the 2026-09-01 note in MDs/analyzer-redesign-2026-08-31.md section 3.2. STRENGTHENED 2026-09-08: turn 1 (Enayem claiming the slot) is new. The original assertion — Karahan stays BENCH and the offer stays open — is satisfied by a pipeline that does nothing at all, because both are the seeded world. First-claim-wins is the case's own rule, so exercising it is the honest way to make the case fail.","adjudication":{"verdict":"new_right","date":"2026-09-08","reason":"Karahan's expectation is unchanged (a non-bencher's nomination does not move him). The second turn is the discriminator: Enayem, a LISTED bencher, claims the slot, so the offer must have still been open for him — and had Adam's nomination wrongly registered Karahan, Enayem would have found a full squad and landed on the bench."}}
{"id":"S13b-bencher-claims-the-open-slot","title":"a listed bench player's own 'I'll take it' claims the slot; nobody else is dropped","sections":["S13"],"category":"B","provenance":{"kind":"commit","ref":"9a12ace","date":"2026-05-19","note":"First-confirm-wins. The claimant is promoted; everyone else STAYS on the bench — the elimination chain that marked Karahan DROPPED while he slept is exactly what this replaced."},"world":{"maxPlayers":14,"players":[{"key":"kemal","name":"Kemal Ediz","role":"OWNER"},{"key":"elvin","name":"Elvin Aliyev","role":"ADMIN"},{"key":"sait","name":"Sait Demir"},{"key":"mustafa","name":"Mustafa Kaya"},{"key":"abid","name":"Abid Hussain"},{"key":"idris","name":"Idris Bello"},{"key":"faris","name":"Faris Nasser"},{"key":"shaz","name":"Shaz Iqbal"},{"key":"adam","name":"Adam Osman"},{"key":"efat","name":"Efat Rahman"},{"key":"usama","name":"Usama Tariq"},{"key":"karahan","name":"Karahan Yildiz"},{"key":"zair","name":"Zair Malik"},{"key":"wasim","name":"Wasim Akhtar"},{"key":"habib","name":"Habib Rahimi"},{"key":"najib","name":"Najib Ahmadi"},{"key":"ehtisham","name":"Ehtisham Ul Haq"},{"key":"mojib","name":"Mojib Sadat"},{"key":"erdal","name":"Erdal Ozkan"},{"key":"enayem","name":"Enayem Rashid"},{"key":"amir","name":"Amir Ahmadi"},{"key":"zeeshan","name":"Zeeshan Khan"},{"key":"ayoub","name":"Ayoub Benali"}],"attendance":[{"key":"kemal","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"elvin","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"sait","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"mustafa","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"abid","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"idris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"faris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"shaz","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"adam","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"efat","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"usama","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"najib","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"zair","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"wasim","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"karahan","status":"BENCH"},{"key":"enayem","status":"BENCH"}],"openBenchSlotByDropping":"wasim"},"history":[{"author":"MatchTime","body":"A slot just opened 🎟 First of Karahan Yildiz, Enayem Rashid to say IN takes it — nobody gets dropped."}],"messages":[{"from":"karahan","body":"I'll take it","route":"self_att","facts":{"claims":[{"subject":"sender","polarity":"in"}]}}],"expect":{"attendance":[{"player":"karahan","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"player":"enayem","status":"BENCH"}],"counts":{"confirmed":14}},"tags":["bench-offer","claim"],"stubKind":"transcribed","adjudication":{"verdict":"harness","date":"2026-09-08","reason":"Expectation untouched. \"I'll take it\" from a listed bencher is a self IN; that it claims the OPEN OFFER, promotes him and drops nobody is the engine's rule, not a reading of the text."}}
{"id":"S14-bench-offer-never-drops-a-bencher","title":"a drop opens ONE offer to the whole bench and removes nobody from it","sections":["S14","S13"],"category":"C","provenance":{"kind":"commit","ref":"0ca6b57","date":"2026-05-19","note":"The sweep no longer drops a bencher: silence is not unavailability. Paired with 7e3284c (2026-05-18, Erdal), where the bot announced 'asking Erdal in DMs', he got no DM and called it misinformation."},"world":{"maxPlayers":14,"players":[{"key":"kemal","name":"Kemal Ediz","role":"OWNER"},{"key":"elvin","name":"Elvin Aliyev","role":"ADMIN"},{"key":"sait","name":"Sait Demir"},{"key":"mustafa","name":"Mustafa Kaya"},{"key":"abid","name":"Abid Hussain"},{"key":"idris","name":"Idris Bello"},{"key":"faris","name":"Faris Nasser"},{"key":"shaz","name":"Shaz Iqbal"},{"key":"adam","name":"Adam Osman"},{"key":"efat","name":"Efat Rahman"},{"key":"usama","name":"Usama Tariq"},{"key":"karahan","name":"Karahan Yildiz"},{"key":"zair","name":"Zair Malik"},{"key":"wasim","name":"Wasim Akhtar"},{"key":"habib","name":"Habib Rahimi"},{"key":"najib","name":"Najib Ahmadi"},{"key":"ehtisham","name":"Ehtisham Ul Haq"},{"key":"mojib","name":"Mojib Sadat"},{"key":"erdal","name":"Erdal Ozkan"},{"key":"enayem","name":"Enayem Rashid"},{"key":"amir","name":"Amir Ahmadi"},{"key":"zeeshan","name":"Zeeshan Khan"},{"key":"ayoub","name":"Ayoub Benali"}],"attendance":[{"key":"kemal","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"elvin","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"sait","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"mustafa","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"abid","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"idris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"faris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"shaz","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"adam","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"efat","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"usama","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"najib","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"zair","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"wasim","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"karahan","status":"BENCH"},{"key":"enayem","status":"BENCH"}]},"history":[{"author":"MatchTime","body":"🗓 *Tuesday 7-a-side* — Tue 21:30 at Goals North Cheam.\n\n*Confirmed (14/14):*\n1. Kemal Ediz\n2. Elvin Aliyev\n3. Sait Demir\n4. Mustafa Kaya\n5. Abid Hussain\n6. Idris Bello\n7. Faris Nasser\n8. Shaz Iqbal\n9. Adam Osman\n10. Efat Rahman\n11. Usama Tariq\n12. Najib Ahmadi\n13. Zair Malik\n14. Wasim Akhtar\n\nSquad is *full* 🙌\n\n*Bench (2):*\n1. Karahan Yildiz\n2. Enayem Rashid"}],"messages":[{"from":"wasim","body":"out, can't make it tonight","route":"self_att","facts":{"claims":[{"subject":"sender","polarity":"out"}]}}],"expect":{"attendance":[{"player":"wasim","status":"DROPPED"},{"player":"karahan","status":"BENCH"},{"player":"enayem","status":"BENCH"}],"counts":{"confirmed":13,"bench":2}},"notes":"This case deliberately does NOT assert the prompt's 'never say in DMs' rule. §3.4 item 3 of the redesign doc shows that rule is now FACTUALLY WRONG — bot-scheduler.ts:1310 does DM each bencher. Encoding it would pin a lie into the corpus.","tags":["bench-offer","drop"],"stubKind":"transcribed","adjudication":{"verdict":"harness","date":"2026-09-08","reason":"Expectation untouched. 'out, can't make it tonight' is a self OUT; opening ONE offer to the whole bench and dropping nobody from it is what the engine does with it."}}
{"id":"S15-erdal-standing-offer-registers","title":"'consider me as the 14th whenever you have 13' registers him, it does not 🤔","sections":["S15"],"category":"B","provenance":{"kind":"commit","ref":"a9e42e5","date":"2026-05-15","player":"Erdal Ozkan","note":"The model 🤔'd and left him unregistered. Flavour (a), the STANDING OFFER, is a commitment contingent on squad state. Its resulting status is settled by PR #27 (ad49e6f): an INFERRED bench is honoured only when the squad is FULL, so with 13/14 the condition is already met and capacity puts him CONFIRMED."},"stubKind":"transcribed","world":{"maxPlayers":14,"players":[{"key":"kemal","name":"Kemal Ediz","role":"OWNER"},{"key":"elvin","name":"Elvin Aliyev","role":"ADMIN"},{"key":"sait","name":"Sait Demir"},{"key":"mustafa","name":"Mustafa Kaya"},{"key":"abid","name":"Abid Hussain"},{"key":"idris","name":"Idris Bello"},{"key":"faris","name":"Faris Nasser"},{"key":"shaz","name":"Shaz Iqbal"},{"key":"adam","name":"Adam Osman"},{"key":"efat","name":"Efat Rahman"},{"key":"usama","name":"Usama Tariq"},{"key":"karahan","name":"Karahan Yildiz"},{"key":"zair","name":"Zair Malik"},{"key":"wasim","name":"Wasim Akhtar"},{"key":"habib","name":"Habib Rahimi"},{"key":"najib","name":"Najib Ahmadi"},{"key":"ehtisham","name":"Ehtisham Ul Haq"},{"key":"mojib","name":"Mojib Sadat"},{"key":"erdal","name":"Erdal Ozkan"},{"key":"enayem","name":"Enayem Rashid"},{"key":"amir","name":"Amir Ahmadi"},{"key":"zeeshan","name":"Zeeshan Khan"},{"key":"ayoub","name":"Ayoub Benali"}],"attendance":[{"key":"kemal","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"elvin","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"sait","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"mustafa","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"abid","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"idris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"faris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"shaz","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"adam","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"efat","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"usama","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"karahan","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"zair","status":"CONFIRMED"}]},"history":[{"author":"MatchTime","body":"🗓 *Tuesday 7-a-side* — Tue 21:30 at Goals North Cheam.\n\n*Confirmed (13/14):*\n1. Kemal Ediz\n2. Elvin Aliyev\n3. Sait Demir\n4. Mustafa Kaya\n5. Abid Hussain\n6. Idris Bello\n7. Faris Nasser\n8. Shaz Iqbal\n9. Adam Osman\n10. Efat Rahman\n11. Usama Tariq\n12. Karahan Yildiz\n13. Zair Malik\n\nWe need *1 more*. Reply *IN* to grab a spot."},{"author":"Zair Malik","body":"one more needed"}],"messages":[{"from":"erdal","body":"consider me as the 14th whenever you have 13 players","route":"offer","facts":{"claims":[{"subject":"sender","polarity":"in","contingent":true,"conditionOn":"squad"}]}}],"expect":{"attendance":[{"player":"erdal","status":"CONFIRMED"}],"counts":{"confirmed":14,"bench":0}},"tags":["conditional","standing-offer"],"adjudication":{"verdict":"harness","date":"2026-09-08","reason":"Expectation untouched. 'consider me as the 14th whenever you have 13' is a commitment conditional on the SQUAD's state — flavour (a) — and `conditionOn: squad` is the field that says so; the engine registers and capacity decides slot vs bench."}}
{"id":"S15b-personal-uncertainty-writes-nothing","title":"'in if my back holds up' is personal uncertainty — no attendance row","sections":["S15"],"category":"B","provenance":{"kind":"commit","ref":"a9e42e5","date":"2026-05-15","note":"Flavour (b). The differentiator is whose condition it is: the SQUAD's state (a standing offer) versus the SENDER's own body/work/family (uncertainty). Both flavours in one message defaults to (b), conservatively."},"world":{"maxPlayers":14,"players":[{"key":"kemal","name":"Kemal Ediz","role":"OWNER"},{"key":"elvin","name":"Elvin Aliyev","role":"ADMIN"},{"key":"sait","name":"Sait Demir"},{"key":"mustafa","name":"Mustafa Kaya"},{"key":"abid","name":"Abid Hussain"},{"key":"idris","name":"Idris Bello"},{"key":"faris","name":"Faris Nasser"},{"key":"shaz","name":"Shaz Iqbal"},{"key":"adam","name":"Adam Osman"},{"key":"efat","name":"Efat Rahman"},{"key":"usama","name":"Usama Tariq"},{"key":"karahan","name":"Karahan Yildiz"},{"key":"zair","name":"Zair Malik"},{"key":"wasim","name":"Wasim Akhtar"},{"key":"habib","name":"Habib Rahimi"},{"key":"najib","name":"Najib Ahmadi"},{"key":"ehtisham","name":"Ehtisham Ul Haq"},{"key":"mojib","name":"Mojib Sadat"},{"key":"erdal","name":"Erdal Ozkan"},{"key":"enayem","name":"Enayem Rashid"},{"key":"amir","name":"Amir Ahmadi"},{"key":"zeeshan","name":"Zeeshan Khan"},{"key":"ayoub","name":"Ayoub Benali"}],"attendance":[{"key":"kemal","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"elvin","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"sait","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"mustafa","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"abid","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"idris","status":"CONFIRMED"}]},"history":[{"author":"MatchTime","body":"🗓 *Tuesday 7-a-side* — Tue 21:30 at Goals North Cheam.\n\n*Confirmed (6/14):*\n1. Kemal Ediz\n2. Elvin Aliyev\n3. Sait Demir\n4. Mustafa Kaya\n5. Abid Hussain\n6. Idris Bello\n\nWe need *8 more*. Reply *IN* to grab a spot."},{"author":"Faris Nasser","body":"who else is playing"}],"messages":[{"from":"usama","body":"in if my back holds up","route":"offer","facts":{"claims":[{"subject":"sender","polarity":"in","contingent":true,"conditionOn":"self"}]}},{"from":"karahan","body":"in","route":"self_att","facts":{"claims":[{"subject":"sender","polarity":"in"}]}}],"expect":{"attendance":[{"player":"usama","status":"ABSENT"},{"player":"karahan","status":"CONFIRMED"}],"counts":{"confirmed":7}},"tags":["conditional","tentative"],"stubKind":"transcribed","notes":"STRENGTHENED 2026-09-08: Karahan's 'in' is a CANARY. 'Writes nothing' is satisfied by a pipeline that reads nothing, so the case needed a write it cannot produce by accident.","adjudication":{"verdict":"new_right","date":"2026-09-08","reason":"Usama's expectation is unchanged (no row); Karahan is a canary and the count moves 6 → 7 with him. 'in if my back holds up' is flavour (b) — the condition is the SENDER's own body — and `conditionOn: self` is the one field that separates it from S15."}}
{"id":"S16-amir-history-vs-roster","title":"a registerFor signs up the NAMED person, not the author — answer from the roster","sections":["S16","S27"],"category":"C","provenance":{"kind":"commit","ref":"c8dd085","date":"2026-05-06","player":"Amir Ahmadi","note":"Amir posted '@Ehtisham Ul Haq In'. Ehtisham was registered, Amir was not (correct). Kemal then asked whether Amir was coming and the model replied 'Amir just said IN at 09:30 — he's confirmed!', inferring from chat history instead of the Confirmed list."},"world":{"maxPlayers":14,"players":[{"key":"kemal","name":"Kemal Ediz","role":"OWNER"},{"key":"elvin","name":"Elvin Aliyev","role":"ADMIN"},{"key":"sait","name":"Sait Demir"},{"key":"mustafa","name":"Mustafa Kaya"},{"key":"abid","name":"Abid Hussain"},{"key":"idris","name":"Idris Bello"},{"key":"faris","name":"Faris Nasser"},{"key":"shaz","name":"Shaz Iqbal"},{"key":"adam","name":"Adam Osman"},{"key":"efat","name":"Efat Rahman"},{"key":"usama","name":"Usama Tariq"},{"key":"karahan","name":"Karahan Yildiz"},{"key":"zair","name":"Zair Malik"},{"key":"wasim","name":"Wasim Akhtar"},{"key":"habib","name":"Habib Rahimi"},{"key":"najib","name":"Najib Ahmadi"},{"key":"ehtisham","name":"Ehtisham Ul Haq"},{"key":"mojib","name":"Mojib Sadat"},{"key":"erdal","name":"Erdal Ozkan"},{"key":"enayem","name":"Enayem Rashid"},{"key":"amir","name":"Amir Ahmadi"},{"key":"zeeshan","name":"Zeeshan Khan"},{"key":"ayoub","name":"Ayoub Benali"}],"attendance":[{"key":"kemal","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"elvin","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"sait","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"mustafa","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"abid","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"idris","status":"CONFIRMED"}]},"history":[{"author":"MatchTime","body":"🗓 *Tuesday 7-a-side* — Tue 21:30 at Goals North Cheam.\n\n*Confirmed (6/14):*\n1. Kemal Ediz\n2. Elvin Aliyev\n3. Sait Demir\n4. Mustafa Kaya\n5. Abid Hussain\n6. Idris Bello\n\nWe need *8 more*. Reply *IN* to grab a spot."}],"messages":[{"from":"amir","turn":0,"body"