{"id":"S19-show-teams-does-not-reshuffle","title":"'show the teams again' re-posts; it never re-runs the balancer","sections":["S19","S18"],"category":"A","provenance":{"kind":"commit","ref":"c408649","date":"2026-06-18","note":"The analyzer's only team intent was generate_teams_request, so any 'show' phrasing re-ran the balancer, reshuffled players and could rename via fun-names — destroying an admin's manual Zeeshan/Nabeel swap."},"world":{"maxPlayers":6,"players":[{"key":"kemal","name":"Kemal Ediz","role":"OWNER"},{"key":"elvin","name":"Elvin Aliyev","role":"ADMIN"},{"key":"sait","name":"Sait Demir"},{"key":"mustafa","name":"Mustafa Kaya"},{"key":"zeeshan","name":"Zeeshan Khan"},{"key":"nabeel","name":"Nabeel Ahmed"}],"attendance":[{"key":"kemal","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"elvin","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"sait","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"mustafa","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"zeeshan","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"nabeel","status":"CONFIRMED"}],"teams":{"kemal":"RED","elvin":"RED","zeeshan":"RED","sait":"YELLOW","mustafa":"YELLOW","nabeel":"YELLOW"}},"history":[{"author":"MatchTime","body":"⚽ *Red*\n1. Kemal Ediz\n2. Elvin Aliyev\n3. Zeeshan Khan\n\n⚽ *Yellow*\n1. Sait Demir\n2. Mustafa Kaya\n3. Nabeel Ahmed"},{"author":"Elvin Aliyev","body":"swapped Zeeshan and Nabeel over, looks fairer"}],"messages":[{"from":"elvin","tag":true,"body":"@Match Time show the teams again","route":"balancer","facts":{"action":"show","includeRefs":[],"teamNames":[],"swaps":[],"pairings":[]}}],"expect":{"unchanged":true,"teamsUnchanged":true,"speaks":"required"},"tags":["teams","idempotence"],"stubKind":"transcribed","adjudication":{"verdict":"harness","date":"2026-09-08","reason":"Expectation untouched. 'show the teams again' is `action: show`, and the whole incident was that the system had no way to say 'show' as distinct from 'generate'."}}
