{"id":"PR33-recruit-ask-must-not-swallow-the-drop","title":"a drop and a recruit ask in one message must do both, in that order, and speak once","sections":["S12","S30","S36"],"category":"A","provenance":{"kind":"pr","ref":"#33","date":"2026-09-01","player":"Najib Ahmadi","note":"Sutton FC, 11:39, in front of the club. The owner posted 'Najib is out. We need one more player.\\n\\nCan someone pls come forward'. MatchTime recorded intent=recruit_recent action=recruit:0 handledBy=fast-path conf=1, reasoning 'admin recruit - invited 0 recent players', and replied 'The squad for *Tuesday 5-a-side* is already full - no open spots to recruit for.' Najib was never dropped: looksLikeRecruitRequest matched the SECOND sentence and the recruit fast path peeled the message off the LLM batch unconditionally, so the third-party OUT was never analysed by anything. The squad stayed 10/10, so the recruit action correctly found zero open spots. Source is the production AnalyzedMessage row for that message. The fix deletes the regex fast path and makes recruit an extracted verdict fact applied AFTER the batch's attendance writes."},"world":{"maxPlayers":10,"players":[{"key":"kemal","name":"Kemal Ediz","role":"OWNER"},{"key":"elvin","name":"Elvin Aliyev","role":"ADMIN"},{"key":"sait","name":"Sait Demir"},{"key":"mustafa","name":"Mustafa Kaya"},{"key":"abid","name":"Abid Hussain"},{"key":"idris","name":"Idris Bello"},{"key":"faris","name":"Faris Nasser"},{"key":"shaz","name":"Shaz Iqbal"},{"key":"adam","name":"Adam Osman"},{"key":"najib","name":"Najib Ahmadi"},{"key":"mojib","name":"Mojib Sadat"},{"key":"zair","name":"Zair Malik"}],"attendance":[{"key":"kemal","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"elvin","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"sait","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"mustafa","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"abid","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"idris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"faris","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"shaz","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"adam","status":"CONFIRMED"},{"key":"najib","status":"CONFIRMED"}],"completedMatch":{"daysAgo":7,"confirmedKeys":["kemal","sait","mojib","zair"]}},"history":[{"author":"MatchTime","body":"⚽ *Tuesday 5-a-side* - Tue, 20:00\n\nConfirmed (10/10):\n1. Kemal Ediz\n2. Elvin Aliyev\n3. Sait Demir\n4. Mustafa Kaya\n5. Abid Hussain\n6. Idris Bello\n7. Faris Nasser\n8. Shaz Iqbal\n9. Adam Osman\n10. Najib Ahmadi\n\nSquad is full."}],"messages":[{"from":"kemal","body":"Najib is out. We need one more player.\n\nCan someone pls come forward","route":"other_att","facts":{"claims":[{"subject":"other","personRef":"Najib","personNamed":true,"polarity":"out"}],"sideRequests":["recruit"]}}],"stubKind":"transcribed","expect":{"attendance":[{"player":"najib","status":"DROPPED"}],"counts":{"confirmed":9},"speaks":"required","speaksAtMost":1,"mustMatch":["DM'?d \\d+ recent player"],"mustNotMatch":["already full","no open spots"]},"tags":["recruit","multi-intent","fast-path","ordering","one-reply"],"adjudication":{"verdict":"harness","date":"2026-09-08","reason":"Expectation untouched. The message carries two facts — a named third-party OUT and a request for players — and `sideRequests` is the field that keeps them both, which is the entire incident (a fast path claimed the message and threw the drop away)."}}
{"id":"PR44-availability-statement-registers-nobody","title":"'I will be back Tuesday week' reports availability; it asks for no squad place","sections":["S3","S15"],"category":"B","provenance":{"kind":"pr","ref":"#44","date":"2026-06-20","player":"Abid Kazmi","note":"PR #44 shipped §10 step 6 with ONE adjudicated spurious write left open, and this is it. The §10 step 6 replay sweep over real production history, batch key g-9e11e1c220:2026-06-20T18:00:34.268Z: Kemal chases the group, Abid Kazmi replies \"I will be back Tuesday week\" 241.5h (ten days) before kickoff with the squad at 0/14, and the engine registered him CONFIRMED. Adjudicated old_right in .e2e/replay/adjudications.jsonl: it is a statement about travel, not a commitment to play, and registering someone who did not ask is the dangerous direction. All three deciders differed — production labelled it out/OUT, the incumbent's replay run wrote nothing, only the engine put him in the squad. The cause was a SCHEMA gap: three live runs of the shipped extractor returned polarity in / contingent false / conditionOn none / tense future, which is byte-for-byte what \"I'm in for next Tuesday\" returns. `Claim.basis` is the field that separates them."},"world":{"maxPlayers":14,"players":[{"key":"kemal","name":"Kemal Ediz","role":"OWNER"},{"key":"elvin","name":"Elvin Aliyev","role":"ADMIN"},{"key":"sait","name":"Sait Demir"},{"key":"mustafa","name":"Mustafa Kaya"},{"key":"abid","name":"Abid Hussain"},{"key":"idris","name":"Idris Bello"},{"key":"faris","name":"Faris Nasser"},{"key":"shaz","name":"Shaz Iqbal"},{"key":"adam","name":"Adam Osman"},{"key":"efat","name":"Efat Rahman"},{"key":"usama","name":"Usama Tariq"},{"key":"karahan","name":"Karahan Yildiz"},{"key":"zair","name":"Zair Malik"},{"key":"wasim","name":"Wasim Akhtar"},{"key":"habib","name":"Habib Rahimi"},{"key":"najib","name":"Najib Ahmadi"},{"key":"ehtisham","name":"Ehtisham Ul Haq"},{"key":"mojib","name":"Mojib Sadat"},{"key":"erdal","name":"Erdal Ozkan"},{"key":"enayem","name":"Enayem Rashid"},{"key":"amir","name":"Amir Ahmadi"},{"key":"zeeshan","name":"Zeeshan Khan"},{"key":"ayoub","name":"Ayoub Benali"}],"attendance":[],"upcomingMatchInDays":10},"history":[{"author":"MatchTime","body":"🗓 *Tuesday 7-a-side* — Tue 21:30 at Goals North Cheam.\n\n*Confirmed (0/14):*\n\nWe need *14 more*. Reply *IN* to grab a spot."},{"author":"Idris Bello","body":"2 very similar games 60+ shots and no goals :("},{"author":"Kemal Ediz","body":"guys, nobody interested? come on, the weather will be beautiful, this is the best activity you can make in the week. Where is everyone?"}],"messages":[{"from":"abid","body":"I will be back Tuesday week"}],"expect":{"counts":{"confirmed":0,"bench":0},"attendance":[{"player":"abid","status":"ABSENT"}]},"tags":["availability","spurious-write","step6"],"liveOnlyReason":"The assertion IS the classification — whether the model reads a travel statement as a commitment to play. A stub would contain the answer, and a `corrected` stub here would be guessing exactly the thing under test."}
{"id":"PR44-a-real-commitment-ten-days-out-still-registers","title":"'I'm in for next Tuesday' ten days out is a commitment and still registers","sections":["S3","S15"],"category":"B","provenance":{"kind":"pr","ref":"#44","date":"2026-06-20","player":"Abid Kazmi","note":"The control for PR44-availability-statement-registers-nobody, and the direction a careless fix breaks. The same sender, the same world, the same ten days to kickoff, the same \"Tuesday\" — a fix written as \"future never registers\" or \"a distant match never registers\" passes the case above and silently starts losing real INs here. The two cases are only separable by what the message DOES, which is what `Claim.basis` records."},"world":{"maxPlayers":14,"players":[{"key":"kemal","name":"Kemal Ediz","role":"OWNER"},{"key":"elvin","name":"Elvin Aliyev","role":"ADMIN"},{"key":"sait","name":"Sait Demir"},{"key":"mustafa","name":"Mustafa Kaya"},{"key":"abid","name":"Abid Hussain"},{"key":"idris","name":"Idris Bello"},{"key":"faris","name":"Faris Nasser"},{"key":"shaz","name":"Shaz Iqbal"},{"key":"adam","name":"Adam Osman"},{"key":"efat","name":"Efat Rahman"},{"key":"usama","name":"Usama Tariq"},{"key":"karahan","name":"Karahan Yildiz"},{"key":"zair","name":"Zair Malik"},{"key":"wasim","name":"Wasim Akhtar"},{"key":"habib","name":"Habib Rahimi"},{"key":"najib","name":"Najib Ahmadi"},{"key":"ehtisham","name":"Ehtisham Ul Haq"},{"key":"mojib","name":"Mojib Sadat"},{"key":"erdal","name":"Erdal Ozkan"},{"key":"enayem","name":"Enayem Rashid"},{"key":"amir","name":"Amir Ahmadi"},{"key":"zeeshan","name":"Zeeshan Khan"},{"key":"ayoub","name":"Ayoub Benali"}],"attendance":[],"upcomingMatchInDays":10},"history":[{"author":"MatchTime","body":"🗓 *Tuesday 7-a-side* — Tue 21:30 at Goals North Cheam.\n\n*Confirmed (0/14):*\n\nWe need *14 more*. Reply *IN* to grab a spot."},{"author":"Idris Bello","body":"2 very similar games 60+ shots and no goals :("},{"author":"Kemal Ediz","body":"guys, nobody interested? come on, the weather will be beautiful, this is the best activity you can make in the week. Where is everyone?"}],"messages":[{"from":"abid","body":"I'm in for next Tuesday"}],"expect":{"attendance":[{"player":"abid","status":"CONFIRMED"}],"counts":{"confirmed":1,"bench":0}},"tags":["availability","step6"],"liveOnlyReason":"Same as its pair: the assertion IS the classification. Stubbing the claim would assert only that the apply path can register somebody, which twenty other cases already do."}
{"id":"PR48-a-courtesy-on-a-state-description-registers-nobody","title":"\"I'm free Tuesday if you need me\" describes a state — it asks for no squad place","sections":["S3","S15"],"category":"B","provenance":{"kind":"pr","ref":"#48","date":"2026-09-05","player":"Ilkay","note":"The availability / standing-offer boundary measured live on 2026-09-05, 6 runs per phrasing against production state. Both ends were stable — \"I'm around if you're short\" returned basis=availability 6/6 and wrote nothing; \"put me down if you're short\" and \"count me as the 14th if you need one\" returned basis=decision 6/6 and registered. The middle was a coin flip: \"I'm free Tuesday if you need me\" returned availability 4/6 and decision 2/6, and 3 of 12 runs wrote CONFIRMED for a player who had asked for nothing. Adding a fourth example to the prompt's availability list was not the fix — \"I'm around if you need me\" was ALREADY in it. PR #48 rewrote the `basis` rule around the VERB: a verb acting on the person (\"I'm free\", \"I'm around\") is availability; a verb acting on the squad (\"put me down\", \"count me in\") is a decision, and a trailing courtesy (\"if you need me\") never promotes the first into the second. Kemal's decision, 2026-09-05: the ambiguous phrasing must NOT register the sender — a real player complained on 1 Sept, verbatim, \"I can't come. Matchtime put my name down as reserve without my confirm\". Availability is necessary and never sufficient."},"world":{"maxPlayers":14,"players":[{"key":"kemal","name":"Kemal Ediz","role":"OWNER"},{"key":"elvin","name":"Elvin Aliyev","role":"ADMIN"},{"key":"sait","name":"Sait Demir"},{"key":"mustafa","name":"Mustafa Kaya"},{"key":"abid","name":"Abid Hussain"},{"key":"idris","name":"Idris Bello"},{"key":"faris","name":"Faris Nasser"},{"key":"shaz","name":"Shaz Iqbal"},{"key":"adam","name":"Adam Osman"},{"key":"efat","name":"Efat Rahman"},{"key":"usama","name":"Usama Tariq"},{"key":"karahan","name":"Karahan Yildiz"},{"key":"zair"